              "number": 7,
              "question": "下面的C++代码执行后其输出是( )。\n\n```cpp\nint i, Sum = 0;\nfor (i = 1; i < 10; i++){\n  Sum += i;\n  if(i % 2) continue;\n  if(i % 7) break;\n}\ncout << Sum;\n```",
