              "question": "C++ 代码,将从小到大依次输出 abs(N) 个整数,并在最后输出 1。\n\n```cpp\nint N;\ncin >> N;\nint start_num = 1, end_num = N + 1, i;\nif (N < 0)\n  start_num = N, end_num = 0;\nfor (i = start_num; i < end_num; i++)\n  cout << i << \" \";\ncout << endl << ((i - 1) == abs(N)) << endl;\n```",
